  "changes_qualified": [
    "Windows uses Safe render threading. Automatic tests D3D12, Vulkan then OpenGL in independent processes; a successful 48-frame 3D readback with the correct API and a fresh token is required.",
    "A 45-second timeout bounds each child test. Interrupted tests are journaled before launch; failed probes are skipped on the next start. Cached success is invalidated when the driver fingerprint changes.",
    "The test executable enters an early branch before original game data, settings, normal session logging and controller initialization. Failed D3D12 on Linux advances to a real Vulkan probe without a manual restart. Separate Vulkan and OpenGL child receipts pass.",
    "A successful small probe cannot confirm the full 3D menu. The next fallback is persisted before menu presentation; an unpresented trial advances on the following launch. Unrelated gameplay crashes do not blacklist APIs.",
    "Automatic and manual D3D12, Vulkan and Compatibility choices, help and status have EN/RU/DE coverage. Manual launchers select Safe rendering before scripts; Compatibility also selects basic graphics.",
    "Packaged Linux runtime completes menu loading, opens a Russian campaign and returns to the menu under Forward+ and Compatibility. Existing Android renderer recovery and first-person action settings pass regression checks.",
    "Tribe icons glow in their own color when represented by the deployed army. Absent tribes remain neutral; scouting does not substitute the rival army for shop indicators. The glow shader also runs in Compatibility without scene bloom.",
    "Recruitment metadata uses translucent chamfered panels with light cost-colored borders; numeric prices and copy counts remain explicit. All price bands, progression counts and matching alliance rows are captured. Trials UI is rendered in EN/RU/DE with the corresponding original language archives.",
    "Trials-only banshee and red harpy tuning passes 46 targeted assertions; campaign prototypes, native spell cache, saved army identities and bonus reapplication remain isolated. 216 native-AI duels before and after are archived separately.",
    "Browser update from published stable 1.12.0 preserves every IndexedDB store, including save and data sentinels."
  ],
