  "diagnostic_assessment": [
    "The supplied 1.11.0 report has all optional effects disabled while the engine is still Forward+ / D3D12 with Separate rendering. Its final trace precedes presentation of the constructed 3D menu; the report screen itself works.",
    "No GPU reset code, thread backtrace or shader failure proves the exact freeze. Safe threading and automatic API recovery avoid retrying the reported failed configuration; no claim is made that the driver defect was reproduced or repaired."
  ],
