  "limits": [
    "No Windows 10 / Intel Iris Xe or ThinkPad E15 Gen 2 runtime was available. The laptop-wide freeze remains unconfirmed as resolved.",
    "Windows, macOS and Android packages were audited, not target-OS runtime-tested. Windows policy tests run on Linux with NVIDIA Vulkan and Mesa llvmpipe OpenGL. D3D12 is unavailable on this host. CMD arguments and packaging were checked; cmd.exe was not executed.",
    "Detection requires the initial 2D game window to open. Native capability fallback handles unsupported APIs before scripts. A driver freeze affecting the entire OS still requires a system restart; the journal chooses the next API afterward.",
    "A previously observed nonfatal shader-cache header error is not addressed. Browser checks cover startup/storage upgrade, not campaign gameplay. Audio uses Dummy; physical devices and remote co-op peers were not retested.",
    "Small deterministic combat samples do not establish global balance. No laptop performance claim is made. Compatibility intentionally has fewer effects."
  ],
  "test_scope_notes": [
    "Compatibility panel captures exclude checks that require short audio clips to remain playing after a fixed number of rendered frames. The same audio assertions pass in all three Forward+ language runs."
  ],
  "deployment_verification": "Hosted hashes and live browser startup must pass before publishing the draft; receipts are retained with the release workspace."
